.TH CTLYRICS 1 "September 2026" "ctlyrics 0.1.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ctlyrics \- terminal lyrics viewer and mapping manager for cmus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ctlyrics
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B ctlyrics web
.RI [ --bind address ]
.RI [ --port port ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ctlyrics
reads playback information from cmus and displays synchronized LRC lyrics in a
terminal interface. It also provides desktop tray integration and a local Web
interface for managing lyric mappings.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Show command help.
.TP
.BR -V , " --version"
Show the program version.
.TP
.BI "--lang " language
Set the interface language to auto, en, or zh-CN.
.SH WEB OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "--bind " address
Address to listen on. The default is 127.0.0.1. Use 0.0.0.0 only when network
access is explicitly required.
.TP
.BR -p , " --port " port
Port to listen on. The default is 3000.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ctlyrics/mappings.json
Music directory and lyric mappings.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ctlyrics/language
Saved TUI and CLI language preference.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/ctlyrics/lyrics/
LRC lyric files.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/ctlyrics/
Application logs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cmus (1),
.BR cmus-remote (1)
